Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:34.86,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}把血肉 心灵 尽数吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:38.36,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:46.37,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}再等我一下 一下就好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.13,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}我如此祈愿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:54.30,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fad(300,300)\be20}只是 只是
